OL,3,AEurope on alert after supermarket
OL,4,Afreezers hit by cyber-attacks in 10
OL,5,Acountries
OL,6,
OL,7,FA spate of cyber-attacks that hit
OL,8,Fsupermarket chains across at least 10
OL,9,FEuropean countries on Monday has
OL,10,Fprompted European Union officials to
OL,11,Fwarn of a deliberate attempt to disrupt
OL,12,Fthe food supply chain.
OL,14,FSupermarkets have reported problems in
OL,15,FBelgium, Estonia, Finland, Ireland,
OL,16,FItaly, Luxembourg, the Netherlands,
OL,17,FPortugal, Germany and Sweden, and the
OL,18,Fsignificant increase in freezer
OL,19,Ftemperatures has forced retailers to
OL,20,Fdiscard food.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
