OL,3,AEurope on alert after supermarket
OL,4,Afreezers hit by cyber-attacks in 10
OL,5,Acountries
OL,6,
OL,7,FTemperatures in chains across Europe
OL,8,Freportedly rose as high as 50C (122F).
OL,10,FNo-one has yet admitted carrying out
OL,11,Fthe cyber-attacks.
